DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
SUMMARY:College Station City Council - FY2027 budget and tax rate adopted (HELD)
LOCATION:College Station City Hall
DESCRIPTION:Held Aug. 27\, 2026. Budget adopted 6-1 at a total of $576\,387\,341 (Yancy against)\; ratification of the property tax revenue increase 5-2 (Yancy and White against)\; 2026 tax rate of $0.530254 per $100 adopted 5-2\; FY27 fee schedule adopted unanimously. Council also directed staff toward Bass Pro Shops and Corinth Group agreements and toward terminating the Plug and Play funding agreement. Tracker BV-0166 through BV-0175.
END:VEVENT
