DTSTAMP:20260802T000000Z
DTSTART:20260810T180000
SUMMARY:Bryan ISD Board of Trustees - workshop and special meeting (HELD)
LOCATION:801 S. Ennis St.\, Bryan\, TX
DESCRIPTION:HELD 8/10: trustees unanimously called a Nov. 3 Voter-Approval Tax Rate Election (2-cent M&O increase\, $0.6769 to $0.6968\; est. ~$5.5M/yr recurring\, not recaptured). Tracker BV-0127.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
