DTSTAMP:20260913T100000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:Bryan City Council - FY2027 tax rate public hearing and first reading (HELD)
LOCATION:Bryan\, TX
DESCRIPTION:HELD. The council took the FIRST reading only of an ordinance proposing a 2026 rate of $0.624000 per $100\, unchanged from 2025. The second and final reading is set for the September 15 special meeting. Bryan no-new-revenue rate $0.672321\; voter-approval rate $0.630480. A motion by Mayor Gutierrez to amend the rate to $0.623500 failed. Tracker BV-0214\, BV-0215.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bvbrief-20261103-uniform-election@brazosvalley
DTSTAMP:20260816T220000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:November 3 uniform election - Brazos Valley items
DESCRIPTION:Ballot includes the Bryan ISD VATRE (2-cent M&O increase)\; the City of Bryan charter amendment on Texas Avenue median removal\; the Bryan general municipal election (Mayor\, SMD 1 & 2)\; and the College Station general and special election (Mayor\, Places 1 & 2\, and the Place 5 unexpired term). Tracker BV-0128/BV-0130/BV-0137. Confidence: Reported.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
