DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260825T190000
SUMMARY:Bryan City Council - FY2027 budget public hearing (HELD)
LOCATION:Municipal Office Building\, 300 S. Texas Ave.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:Held Aug. 25\, 2026 at a special meeting. Public hearing plus first reading only of an ordinance adopting a $569\,013\,800 FY2027 budget\; approved unanimously on first reading. The budget itself was not adopted and the tax rate was not taken up. No one signed up to speak. Tracker BV-0176 through BV-0179.
END:VEVENT
