LOCATION:Brazos County Health District
DESCRIPTION:Noticed for Aug. 25\, 2026 at 10 a.m. to convene in closed executive session under Government Code section 551.074 regarding district staff concerns and to take action in open session afterward if necessary. No minutes posted and no outcome disclosed. Tracker BV-0195.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
