DTSTAMP:20260830T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260827T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260827T120000
SUMMARY:Texas A&M System Board of Regents - special called telephonic meeting (HELD)
LOCATION:Board Meeting Room\, Board of Regents Annex\, Gene Stallings Blvd.\, College Station
DESCRIPTION:Held Aug. 27\, 2026. Regents unanimously approved Jerry R. Strawser as interim provost and executive vice president effective Sept. 1 through May 2027\, and certified system compliance with state law on tenured faculty evaluations\, research security and DEI ahead of a Sept. 1 deadline. All five agenda items passed unanimously. Tracker BV-0192.
END:VEVENT
