LOCATION:3037 E. 29th St.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:Second public tour of the new medical examiner's office before it begins receiving cases Sept. 1. Source: WTAW\, Aug. 18\, 2026. Tracker BV-0151.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
