DTSTAMP:20260823T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T091500
SUMMARY:Brazos County Commissioners Court - FY2026-27 budget public hearing (HELD)
LOCATION:Brazos County Administration Building\, 200 S. Texas Ave.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:HELD 9/1: hearing held at 8:30 a.m. ahead of the 10 a.m. regular session\, at which the court adopted a fiscal 2027 budget of $482\,336\,738 on a 4-1 vote. Tracker BV-0196.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bvbrief-20260901-brazoscc-taxhearing@brazosvalley
DTSTAMP:20260823T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T100000
SUMMARY:Brazos County Commissioners Court - 2026 tax rate public hearing (HELD)
LOCATION:Brazos County Administration Building\, 200 S. Texas Ave.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:HELD 9/1: hearing held at 9:15 a.m. on the proposed $0.448474 rate. The court later adopted $0.443474\, above the no-new-revenue rate of $0.414658 and below the voter-approval rate of $0.455272. Tracker BV-0197.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bvbrief-20260901-brazoscc-regular@brazosvalley
DTSTAMP:20260823T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260901T120000
SUMMARY:Brazos County Commissioners Court - regular session (HELD\, budget and rate adopted)
LOCATION:Brazos County Administration Building\, 200 S. Texas Ave.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:HELD 9/1: adopted the FY2027 budget 4-1 and a 2026 tax rate of $0.443474 per $100 3-2\, ratified the tax increase 3-2\, enacted a countywide burn ban\, established the county medical examiner office effective Oct. 1\, approved interlocals with Texas A&M and the City of Wixon Valley\, tabled RFP #26-088\, and approved a settlement in Cause No. 25-002851. Tracker BV-0196 through BV-0204.
END:VEVENT
