LOCATION:Texas Ave. between 27th and 28th St.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:Lane closure for the Brazos County Administration Building remodel\, expected to remain through the end of 2026\; may affect a Brazos Transit bus stop. Source: Brazos County traffic alert\, Aug. 20\, 2026. Tracker BV-0152.
