DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260914T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260914T200000
SUMMARY:Bryan ISD Board of Trustees - special meeting (HELD)
LOCATION:Bryan ISD\, 801 S. Ennis St.\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:The board adopted a signed resolution declaring 4.66 acres at 1918 and 1920 North Earl Rudder Freeway surplus and authorizing a sale under Chapter 272 of the Local Government Code\, and approved an increase in starting bus driver pay from $18.65 to $22 an hour. A November 3 voter-approval tax rate election update was an information item with no vote. No minutes posted. Tracker BV-0244 and BV-0245.
END:VEVENT
