SUMMARY:Brazos County ESD No. 3 - tax rate meeting and public hearing (HELD\, rate adopted)
LOCATION:Precinct 3 VFD Station 2\, 5725 Elmo Weedon Road\, College Station
DESCRIPTION:HELD. The district adopted a 2026 total rate of $0.026642 per $100\, all maintenance and operations with no debt service\, equal to its voter-approval rate\, against a no-new-revenue rate of $0.024269. Vote 3 for\, 0 against\, 2 absent. Tracker BV-0226.
