DTSTAMP:20260920T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260915T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260915T213000
SUMMARY:College Station ISD Board of Trustees - 2026 tax rate adoption (HELD)
LOCATION:CSISD Board Room\, 1812 Welsh Ave.\, College Station
DESCRIPTION:The board adopted a 2026 total rate of $0.9702 per $100\, $0.6912 maintenance and operations plus $0.2790 interest and sinking\, above its certified no-new-revenue rate of $0.957456. It also approved a $25\,392\,035 guaranteed maximum price for a new central office and renovation of the existing one\, and proposed the mid-contract termination of a term contract under Education Code Chapter 21. Tracker BV-0240 through BV-0243.
END:VEVENT
