LOCATION:Brazos County Administration Building\, 200 S. Texas Ave.\, Suite 106\, Bryan
DESCRIPTION:The hearing preceded the 10 a.m. regular session\, which adopted Order 26-008 setting a 6 percent Local Provider Participation Fund rate for fiscal 2027 and designating Truist Bank as depository. Tracker BV-0248.
END:VEVENT
