DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:Bryan Texas Utilities aerial drone grid inspections begin
LOCATION:Brazos and Burleson counties
DESCRIPTION:BTU and a contractor inspect transmission and distribution systems by drone through September 29 as preventive maintenance. No service disruptions are expected. Tracker BV-0258.
END:VEVENT
